# Some Custom Direct Domains

# Fix: override upstream ProxyGFWlist misclassification (not our domains)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ip138.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,openwrt.org.cn

# Fix: override upstream ad-list false positive (not our domains). Must sit before the ads rule-set.
# v2fly/MetaCubeX category-ads-all tags +.byteadverts.com, but Qianchuan / Ocean Engine serve their
# whole frontend from lf*-ad-platform.byteadverts.com, so blocking it blanks those sites (2026-09-22).
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,byteadverts.com

